head,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0551:b003:l013","ordinal":118828,"en":"A lacquered pipe with a golden crescent,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0551:b003:l014","ordinal":118829,"en":"The great Kalcha, big as a hut—"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0551:b003:l015","ordinal":118830,"en":"His eyes were like the beds of lakes,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0551:b003:l016","ordinal":118831,"en":"His appearance could drain one's life,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0551:b003:l017","ordinal":118832,"en":"His brow like a hollow holding a lake,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0551:b003:l018","ordinal":118833,"en":"As though he would swallow anyone who challenged him."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0551:b003:l019","ordinal":118834,"en":"The space between his brows"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0551:b003:l020","ordinal":118835,"en":"Was like an upland pasture where a rich man camped;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0551:b003:l021","ordinal":118836,"en":"The corners of his two eyes"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0551:b003:l022","ordinal":118837,"en":"Were like graves opened wide."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0551:b003:l023","ordinal":118838,"en":"His mustache standing straight up"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0551:b003:l024","ordinal":118839,"en":"Was like a greased axe handle;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0551:b003:l025","ordinal":118840,"en":"His dangling nose"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0551:b003:l026","ordinal":118841,"en":"Was like the sheath of a cutlass."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0551:b003:l027","ordinal":118842,"en":"Cotton sash and broad boots,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0551:b003:l028","ordinal":118843,"en":"Konurbai, khan of the monks,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0551:b003:l029","ordinal":118844,"en":"That majestic swine himself,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0551:b003:l030","ordinal":118845,"en":"A fellow skilled among spearmen,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0551:b003:l031","ordinal":118846,"en":"A mighty fellow who knew the enemy's tricks!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0551:b003:l033","ordinal":118847,"en":"The wretch's black horse—"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0551:b003:l034","ordinal":118848,"en":"That black horse had"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0551:b003:l035","ordinal":118849,"en":"Wings upon its flanks."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0551:b003:l036","ordinal":118850,"en":"When his wrath was roused,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0551:b003:l037","ordinal":118851,"en":"All the lands, however many,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0551:b003:l038","ordinal":118852,"en":"He habitually ground like roasted grain."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0551:b003:l039","ordinal":118853,"en":"His fortunes were complete;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0551:b004:l001","ordinal":118854,"en":"He was a hero born among the Chinese."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0551:b004:l002","ordinal":118855,"en":"My father who departed for eternity—"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0551:b004:l003","ordinal":118856,"en":"This Kalcha, deceiving him,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0551:b004:l004","ordinal":118857,"en":"Had indeed the means to bring his death."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0551:b004:l005","ordinal":118858,"en":"That Kalcha, surpassing other men,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0551:b004:l006","ordinal":118859,"en":"Among round-headed mortals"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0551:b004:l007","ordinal":118860,"en":"Was a being created."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0551:b004:l008","ordinal":118861,"en":"He was a red-walled fortress for China."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0551:b004:l009","ordinal":118862,"en":"Kalcha himself was huge of stature,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0551:b004:l010","ordinal":118863,"en":"A massive warrior—"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0551:b004:l011","ordinal":118864,"en":"Konurbai, son of Alööke;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0551:b004:l012","ordinal":118865,"en":"My wretched mother painted him in the picture."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0551:b004:l013","ordinal":118866,"en":"Beyond him,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0551:b004:l014","ordinal":118867,"en":"Coral plumes and precious coral stones,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0551:b004:l015","ordinal":118868,"en":"A thousand khans of the lungtung rank"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0551:b004:l016","ordinal":118869,"en":"Among Konurbai's company."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0551:b004:l017","ordinal":118870,"en":"Of the Chinese in sleeveless coats,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0551:b004:l018","ordinal":118871,"en":"Setting their mighty men apart,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0551:b004:l019","ordinal":118872,"en":"She painted them in the picture."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0551:b004:l020","ordinal":118873,"en":"Of the Chinese adorned with stones,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0551:b004:l021","ordinal":118874,"en":"Setting their chosen ones apart,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0551:b004:l022","ordinal":118875,"en":"She painted them too."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0551:b004:l023","ordinal":118876,"en":"Making the spearmen strain forward,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0551:b004:l024","ordinal":118877,"en":"Making the swift Chinese foot-runners surge,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0551:b004:l025","ordinal":118878,"en":"Making the khan of the dog-eaters charge across,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0551:b004:l027","ordinal":118879,"en":"My mother painted them all."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0551:b004:l028","ordinal":118880,"en":"Those in mail of iron cords,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0551:b004:l029","ordinal":118881,"en":"All the dagger-handed men,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0551:b004:l030","ordinal":118882,"en":"Their fleet and skillful horsemen,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0551:b004:l031","ordinal":118883,"en":"The host of countless Chinese,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0551:b004:l032","ordinal":118884,"en":"She painted their joining battle."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0551:b004:l033","ordinal":118885,"en":"The great havoc and turmoil,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0551:b004:l034","ordinal":118886,"en":"She painted their fighting."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0551:b004:l035","ordinal":118887,"en":"The unbelievers were exceedingly many,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0551:b004:l036","ordinal":118888,"en":"Swarming like ants,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0551:b004:l037","ordinal":118889,"en":"Seething more thickly than gnats."},