id":"semetey-1-2013:p0552:b003:l020","ordinal":118911,"en":"Kanyshai, khan of the Torgut,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0552:b003:l021","ordinal":118912,"en":"Muzkindik, khan of the Solon,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0552:b003:l022","ordinal":118913,"en":"Orokkyr, khan of the dog-eaters,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0552:b003:l023","ordinal":118914,"en":"Tiken the giant, Orokkyr's son,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0552:b003:l024","ordinal":118915,"en":"Kojojash, Karajoi's son,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0552:b003:l025","ordinal":118916,"en":"The fighting with these men,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0552:b003:l026","ordinal":118917,"en":"The crowded battlefield, the great campaign,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0552:b003:l027","ordinal":118918,"en":"Plunging them in dark blood,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0552:b003:l028","ordinal":118919,"en":"She painted the blood in the picture."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0552:b003:l029","ordinal":118920,"en":"The great campaign, the many slaughters,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0552:b003:l030","ordinal":118921,"en":"She painted these too."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0552:b003:l031","ordinal":118922,"en":"Unbelievers and Muslims—"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0552:b003:l032","ordinal":118923,"en":"She painted their clash,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0552:b003:l033","ordinal":118924,"en":"Drenched in thick blood,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0552:b003:l034","ordinal":118925,"en":"She painted their fighting."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0552:b003:l035","ordinal":118926,"en":"Spear points clashing,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0552:b003:l036","ordinal":118927,"en":"Men's heads striking together,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0552:b003:l037","ordinal":118928,"en":"Their fangs jutting out,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0552:b003:l038","ordinal":118929,"en":"Horse carcasses falling in mountains,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0552:b003:l039","ordinal":118930,"en":"Their mustaches bristling,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0552:b004:l001","ordinal":118931,"en":"Warriors' corpses falling in heaps,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0552:b004:l002","ordinal":118932,"en":"Earth flying, dust burning,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0552:b004:l003","ordinal":118933,"en":"She painted the dust in the picture."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0552:b004:l004","ordinal":118934,"en":"Lying dead and twisted,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0552:b004:l005","ordinal":118935,"en":"She painted the people in the picture."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0552:b004:l006","ordinal":118936,"en":"Hacking with battle-axes,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0552:b004:l007","ordinal":118937,"en":"Clashing with spears,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0552:b004:l008","ordinal":118938,"en":"Turning their coursers' heads,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0552:b004:l009","ordinal":118939,"en":"When the chance came,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0552:b004:l010","ordinal":118940,"en":"Fighting with swords,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0552:b004:l011","ordinal":118941,"en":"Seizing collars and pulling,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0552:b004:l012","ordinal":118942,"en":"At a distance, at one another"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0552:b004:l013","ordinal":118943,"en":"Firing their guns,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0552:b004:l014","ordinal":118944,"en":"Staring without turning away,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0552:b004:l015","ordinal":118945,"en":"When they met one another,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0552:b004:l016","ordinal":118946,"en":"Thrusting home their spears,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0552:b004:l017","ordinal":118947,"en":"Riding out to joust in single combat,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0552:b004:l018","ordinal":118948,"en":"Their steel points bending,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0552:b004:l019","ordinal":118949,"en":"Bloodied and steeped in blood,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0552:b004:l020","ordinal":118950,"en":"Unbelievers and Muslims,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0552:b004:l021","ordinal":118951,"en":"Standing their ground and fighting,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0552:b004:l023","ordinal":118952,"en":"She painted the people in the picture.","gapBefore":"[Source wording unresolved; translation pending]"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0552:b004:l024","ordinal":118953,"en":"Fleeing in a fluster,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0552:b004:l025","ordinal":118954,"en":"She painted the people in the picture."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0552:b004:l026","ordinal":118955,"en":"Many a swift courser's"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0552:b004:l027","ordinal":118956,"en":"Saddle had slipped beneath its belly;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0552:b004:l028","ordinal":118957,"en":"There were many of these running loose."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0552:b004:l029","ordinal":118958,"en":"“My dear, precious kinsman"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0552:b004:l030","ordinal":118959,"en":"Died in this campaign!” they said;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0552:b004:l031","ordinal":118960,"en":"There were many of these wailing."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0552:b004:l032","ordinal":118961,"en":"Their cruppers broken,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0552:b004:l033","ordinal":118962,"en":"Their saddles slipped onto their horses' necks,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0552:b004:l034","ordinal":118963,"en":"There were many of these in a panic."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0552:b004:l035","ordinal":118964,"en":"Having dropped their spears,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0552:b004:l036","ordinal":118965,"en":"“Now, if a spearman comes, he will beat us!” they said;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0552:b004:l037","ordinal":118966,"en":"There were many of these fleeing."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0552:b004:l038","ordinal":118967,"en":"Their saddle girths broken,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0552:b004:l039","ordinal":118968,"en":"There were many of these in a panic."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0553:b003:l001","ordinal":118969,"en":"Wounded by spear thrusts,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0553:b003:l002","ordinal":118970,"en":"There were many of these in misery."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0553:b003:l003","ordinal":118971,"en":"Unable to understand the course of the gunfire,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0553:b003:l004","ordinal":118972,"en":"There were many people blinded."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0553:b003:l005","ordinal":118973,"en":"“This battle will bring slaughter!” they said;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0553:b003:l006","ordinal":118974,"en":"There were many of these grieving."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0553:b003:l007","ordinal":118975,"en":"Of their arms and legs entirely"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0553:b003:l008","ordinal":118976,"en":"There were many bereft."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0553:b003:l009","ordinal":118977,"en":"The commander of ten bobbing along,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0553:b003:l010","ordinal":118978,"en":"The commander of fifty standing out,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0553:b003:l011","ordinal":118979,"en":"The commander of a hundred pounding,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0553:b003:l012","ordinal":118980,"en":"The commander of a thousand booming."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0553:b003:l013","ordinal":118981,"en":"The sky was clear, the earth overcast;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0553:b003:l014","ordinal":118982,"en":"Not one blade could be seen upon the ground."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0553:b003:l015","ordinal":118983,"en":"The face of the sun becoming one,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0553:b003:l016","ordinal":118984,"en":"This battle of Beijing"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0553:b003:l017","ordinal":118985,"en":"Merging with the face of the earth,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0553:b003:l018","ordinal":118986,"en":"Unbelievers and Muslims,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0553:b003:l019","ordinal":118987,"en":"My mother painted their clash."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0553:b003:l020","ordinal":118988,"en":"Such was the unbelievers' appearance;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0553:b003:l021","ordinal":118989,"en":"Your orphan, standing and looking,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0553:b003:l022","ordinal":118990,"en":"When he turned his eyes toward Islam,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0553:b003:l023","ordinal":118991,"en":"The wolf-man lion who departed for eternity,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0553:b003:l024","ordinal":118992,"en":"The dark wolf-man leopard,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0553:b003:l025","ordinal":118993,"en":"Riding a horse like Akkula,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0553:b003:l026","ordinal":118994,"en":"Wearing a coat like Akkolpok,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0553:b003:l027","ordinal":118995,"en":"Having plentiful ammunition loaded,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0553:b003:l028","ordinal":118996,"en":"Lest a stray shot should strike,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0553:b003:l029","ordinal":118997,"en":"The boundlessly swift Akkula"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0553:b003:l030","ordinal":118998,"en":"He had covered with a patterned horsecloth."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0553:b003:l031","ordinal":118999,"en":"Lest distant journeys prove impossible,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0553:b003:l032","ordinal":119000,"en":"Upon all four hooves"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0553:b003:l033","ordinal":119001,"en":"He had golden horseshoes nailed."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0553:b003:l034","ordinal":119002,"en":"Of middle stature, broad of shoulder,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0553:b003:l035","ordinal":119003,"en":"Both a wrestler and a lion,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0553:b003:l036","ordinal":119004,"en":"My sultan father, Manas the hero."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0553:b003:l037","ordinal":119005,"en":"Nine were his protectors,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0553:b003:l038","ordinal":119006,"en":"Gathering beneath his arms,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0553:b003:l039","ordinal":119007,"en":"Nine were those who gave him aid,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0553:b005:l001","ordinal":119008,"en":"Gathering on every side,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0553:b005:l002","ordinal":119009,"en":"A black-spotted leopard"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0553:b005:l003","ordinal":119010,"en":"Raging at his flank."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0553:b005:l004","ordinal":119011,"en":"A short-tailed, shaggy-maned lion,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0553:b005:l005","ordinal":119012,"en":"My father's spiritual patrons"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0553:b005:l006","ordinal":119013,"en":"Readied themselves on every side."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0553:b005:l007","ordinal":119014,"en":"My father's Boz Kise belt gleaming at his waist,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0553:b005:l008","ordinal":119015,"en":"Akkelte, brought into gunfire,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0553:b005:l009","ordinal":119016,"en":"Gleaming upon my father's back."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0553:b005:l010","ordinal":119017,"en":"Six keen blades descended from heaven,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0553:b005:l012","ordinal":119018,"en":"Zulpukor, which Khan Manas acquired,","gapBefore":"[Source wording unresolved; translation pending]"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0553:b005:l013","ordinal":119019,"en":"Gleaming at his wrist."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0553:b005:l014","ordinal":119020,"en":"The lacquered spear made by his friend Bölökbai"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0553:b005:l015","ordinal":119021,"en":"Showing beneath his right thigh,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0553:b005:l016","ordinal":119022,"en":"A helmet of blue iron"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0553:b005:l017","ordinal":119023,"en":"Set down over his head,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0553:b005:l018","ordinal":119024,"en":"The Chinese and Manchus who tormented them"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0553:b005:l019","ordinal":119025,"en":"He drove off, forcing them to flee."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0553:b005:l020","ordinal":119026,"en":"The blood-shedding leopard, the precious lion,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0553:b005:l021","ordinal":119027,"en":"My father she painted in the picture."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0553:b005:l022","ordinal":119028,"en":"On the nearer side of him,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0553:b005:l023","ordinal":119029,"en":"Wearing a blue-gray lynx-fur cap,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0553:b005:l024","ordinal":119030,"en":"Riding a horse like a blue-gray courser,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0553:b005:l025","ordinal":119031,"en":"Wielding a mottled blue shield,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0553:b005:l026","ordinal":119032,"en":"Finding words when taken by surprise,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0553:b005:l027","ordinal":119033,"en":"Finding sight in the dark of night,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0553:b005:l028","ordinal":119034,"en":"Islam's young foal,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0553:b005:l029","ordinal":119035,"en":"The very son of saintliness,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0553:b005:l030","ordinal":119036,"en":"The most skilled of those who took up spears,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0553:b005:l031","ordinal":119037,"en":"The finest of common men,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0553:b005:l032","ordinal":119038,"en":"The wrestler among the forty companions,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0553:b005:l033","ordinal":119039,"en":"Khan Manas's warrior,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0553:b005:l034","ordinal":119040,"en":"The Muslims' resourceful champion,"}]
